    {
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "caption": "Only the differing ranges are streamed and merged.",
      "narration": "Only the mismatching leaf ranges are streamed and reconciled. The Cassandra nodetool repair command builds Merkle trees this way before streaming differences.",
